1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,252
One missed server update cost a

2
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:04,721
Wall Street trading giant over 460

3
00:00:04,721 --> 00:00:06,900
million dollars in 45 minutes.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,559
A technician manually copied new code

5
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:10,781
to seven servers,

6
00:00:10,781 --> 00:00:12,075
missed the eighth,

7
00:00:12,075 --> 00:00:14,519
