9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,119
At market open,

10
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:19,633
that server fired millions of orders,

11
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:22,215
racking up 4 million executions across

12
00:00:22,215 --> 00:00:25,069
397 million shares before engineers pulled

13
00:00:25,069 --> 00:00:25,680
the plug.

14
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,044
An internal system had sent 97

15
00:00:28,044 --> 00:00:30,645
Power Peg emails before the open,

16
00:00:30,645 --> 00:00:33,325
but nobody treated them as alerts.

17
00:00:33,325 --> 00:00:35,689
Knight later paid a 12 million

18
00:00:35,689 --> 00:00:36,950
